# C# style

RulePackVersion: 1.7.0

## Quick rules

- PascalCase for types, methods, properties.
- camelCase for private fields (unless project override documented in input).
- File name aligns with primary type name.
- Flag enum-only .cs files owned by a single type (prefer nest in owner).
- Functions at one abstraction level.
- Flag classes with more than five constructor dependencies as possible SRP violations.
- Public types and non-obvious public boundary methods should have XML summaries; flag redundant summaries that restate the name.
- Inline comments explain why - not line narration or inspector setup.
